      "why_included": "PV typically presents with elevated hemoglobin and low EPO, not leukostasis with blasts. However, post-PV myelofibrosis can undergo blast transformation. Given the current presentation is inconsistent with chronic-phase PV, this is a lower-priority child but still relevant for completeness in the chronic myeloproliferative family."
